valid, policy held: admitted
valid, no policy held: lease names a policy this conduit does not hold
unbound: this instance is not bound to a requester; launch it with -Requester, -Grantors and -Identity
untrusted grantor: lease grantor is not trusted by this instance
bad signature: lease signature does not verify
self-granted: lease is self-granted
held by another key: lease is held by another key
another audience: lease is addressed to another conduit
lifetime over the maximum: lease lifetime exceeds this instance's maximum or is empty
before not_before: lease is not current
at expires: lease is not current
scopes disagree: lease scopes disagree
flow rules: admitted
malformed flow rule: lease flow rule 1 is malformed
console flow rule: lease flow rule 0 forbids a flow between the requester's own channels
gates: lease carries approval gates, which this conduit does not check yet
conditions: lease carries conditions this conduit cannot evaluate
scope outside the lease: lease does not cover FileSystem.Write "/"
read label, write lease: lease does not cover FileSystem.Read "/jake/homework/"
other policy held: lease names a policy this conduit does not hold
unhex 0a0bff: [10 11 255 ]
unhex odd: refused
unhex upper: refused
unhex empty: refused
hex: 000f10ff
seconds ten digits: 1793529430
seconds sixteen digits: -1
